{"id":"4021599065104942508","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"我真的火很大\n來 我三天都在一樓 誰到時候把政治帶進演唱會我看一個檢舉一個\n看你們是要乖乖摸摸鼻子被沒收還是繼續堅持\n「追星就是政治啊、先是台灣人才是追星人」\n有本事就堅持然後被請出場\n一直出現在我版面真的超級煩 真的不要被我碰到\n洋流到底關BTS什麼事😍😍😍😍\n我100%支持帶🇹🇼國旗","username":"yi_i021_1","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@yi_i021_1/post/DfPlwrYn4Ws","timestamp":"2026-11-02T15:06:29Z","media_type":"IMAGE","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-02T19:50:38.576142898Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-02T19:51:05.295699Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-02T19:51:05.295699Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_ee9c8e0df60d3211","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
